<title>UK: London gold fixes barely firmer as PGMs hold gains.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes barely firmer as PGMs hold gains.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $343.80 vs $343.70 AM. barely changed and lightly traded all day. Little direction from quiet New York opening. Some supporter from firmer PGMs.</p>
<p>SILVER - Steady and unchanged at $4.78/$4.80.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Holding firmer overnight levels at $455.00/$460.00 up $14.90. Two-way business</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Also holding gains at $216.00/$221.00, up $9.40.</p>
</text>
